---
import { qwenGuide } from '../lib/status';
---

<div class="not-prose my-6 rounded-xl border border-line bg-raised/60 p-4">
  <p class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-faint">Verify this week — do not trust a frozen pin</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
    From <code class="font-mono">src/data/qwen-recommendations.yaml</code>. A stack that passed last month still has to pass these on <em>your</em> box.
  </p>
  <ol class="mt-4 grid gap-3">
    {qwenGuide.smoke_tests.map((test, i) => (
      <li class="text-sm">
        <span class="font-medium">{i + 1}. {test.name}.</span>
        <span class="text-muted"> Prompt: “{test.prompt}” Expect: {test.expect}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-faint">
    tok/s is a sanity check (CPU crawl vs GPU), not a spec sheet. If VRAM never moves, you failed before the model did.
  </p>
</div>
